Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.68,0:00:02.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No way! I refuse to accept that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.98,0:00:04.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.35,0:00:07.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Accept it or not, I am Ken Takakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.40,0:00:09.61,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.61,0:00:10.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't wanna hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.73,0:00:12.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Crap! The curse!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.24,0:00:14.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase! Hurry!\NYour psychic powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.91,0:00:17.78,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Lemme gobble that weenie!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.13,0:00:29.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.46,0:00:33.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's set a few rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.97,0:00:35.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No speaking your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.05,0:00:38.14,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.27,0:00:53.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Because you like the occult, you're Okarun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.32,0:00:55.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,O-Okarun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.24,0:00:58.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If you use that name, I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.03,0:01:02.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,"That name"? It's my own name.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.62,0:01:07.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I have no choice,\Nso that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.37,0:01:10.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You don't seem that upset about it,\NOkarun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.46,0:01:12.71,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What? This is against my will!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.71,0:01:14.84,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, lemme see your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.05,0:01:19.51,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're looking happy, Okarun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.81,0:01:27.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Stinky!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.35,0:01:30.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You farted in front of my face!\NYou're the worst!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.61,0:01:33.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's because you're\Nputting pressure on me, Miss Ayase!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.11,0:01:37.99,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec! It's already morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.20,0:01:41.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That means Turbo Granny\Nwon't come out anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.37,0:01:44.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.41,0:01:47.96,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I mean, ghosts show up at night, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.21,0:01:51.42,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Why don't you come to my place for now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.21,0:01:54.71,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That outfit...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.05,0:01:57.84,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,is scarier than a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.21,0:03:43.34,BD Center Right,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,EPISODE 2\NTHAT'S A SPACE ALIEN,\NAIN'T IT?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.40,0:03:42.61,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,My Grandma's really hard on guys,\Nso be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.61,0:03:44.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,She almost killed a previous boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.57,0:03:47.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? You wait till now to say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.37,0:03:54.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.63,0:04:04.51,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.23,0:04:12.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Must be this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.23,0:04:12.43,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,PEACEFUL PROSPEROUS FAMILY\NWARD AGAINST EVIL AND MISFORTUNE
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.64,0:04:13.89,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Sorry, Okarun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.19,0:04:15.81,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,A barrier's been put up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.57,0:04:21.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I thought I was gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.36,0:04:27.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okay, now try coming in!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.53,0:04:29.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Is it really gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.49,0:04:32.71,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If you burn, I'll toss you\Ninto the river again, so it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.68,0:04:55.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Whoa. Freaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.35,0:04:57.27,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.40,0:04:59.44,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.82,0:05:00.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Any changes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.90,0:05:03.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,My entire body tingles.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.57,0:05:06.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,More like, what's with your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.53,0:05:09.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Totally hilarious! It's a granny perm!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.99,0:05:12.79,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Freaky! What are you laughing about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.87,0:05:15.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I was about to die there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.75,0:05:19.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.92,0:05:23.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? Grandma's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.71,0:05:25.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh well. Come on up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.55,0:05:29.26,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,E-Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.98,0:05:37.23,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hold on a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.52,0:05:39.23,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll change clothes, so close the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.40,0:05:40.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.49,0:05:47.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase! The curse!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.36,0:05:49.99,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't just open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.33,0:05:52.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Face the wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.70,0:05:55.91,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,STAY OUT
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.29,0:05:58.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.71,0:06:01.42,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Sheesh, what a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.73,0:06:22.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, put these on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.82,0:06:24.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's ladieswear but it should be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.23,0:06:26.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Sorry to trouble you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.74,0:06:30.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,By the way, you don't have\Nanything down there, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.57,0:06:33.45,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.33,0:06:36.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I didn't look!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.54,0:06:37.96,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.13,0:06:45.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.13,0:06:50.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Show me what's down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.89,0:06:55.14,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Turbo Granny was saying that you're cursed\Nbecause your weenie has been taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.02,0:06:59.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.31,0:07:03.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What? No way!\NWhat's it look like? Show me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.27,0:07:05.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I can't show you! Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.69,0:07:07.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But there's nothing there, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.32,0:07:09.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The issue isn't whether or not it's there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.95,0:07:11.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Man, you're so cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.95,0:07:13.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This is the worst!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.91,0:07:15.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.37,0:07:16.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's not there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.54,0:07:18.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't make it sound like I'm the villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.83,0:07:21.04,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're the one who challenged me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.25,0:07:22.04,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.04,0:07:25.75,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I wasn't interested\Nin your occult stories to begin with!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.75,0:07:28.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I only picked a fight\Nbecause you kept talking to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.72,0:07:36.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I didn't want to miss my chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.18,0:07:41.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I've always wanted a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.81,0:07:47.44,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So I thought,\NI didn't want to miss this chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.53,0:07:52.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's why I so desperately\Nstarted talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.50,0:08:00.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But in the end...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.41,0:08:04.92,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You live in a different world, Miss Ayase.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.54,0:08:08.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're not someone that a person like me\Nshould be talking to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.96,0:08:11.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.30,0:08:14.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,that I roped you into so much danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.68,0:08:19.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,When this is all over,\Nyou can just ignore me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.85,0:08:23.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's the annoying part about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.73,0:08:28.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You assume how others feel\Nand jump to conclusions without asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.40,0:08:32.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The reason you don't have friends\Nis because you shove them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.91,0:08:41.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't say that I can ignore you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.62,0:08:44.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We can just talk about\Nthe occult like normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.76,0:08:54.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.05,0:08:56.09,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Poke, poke.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.39,0:09:01.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're so ugly!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.68,0:09:02.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.68,0:09:04.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What did you just say, punk?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.85,0:09:06.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You are completely tactless, Miss Ayase!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.94,0:09:08.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You bluntly recite people's weaknesses!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.94,0:09:11.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What the hell is tact?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.45,0:09:17.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Perhaps your grandmother is back?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.11,0:09:19.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Shh! Stay quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.58,0:09:21.62,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I've never heard a doorbell like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.49,0:09:24.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.00,0:09:26.04,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Grandma told me in the past...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.21,0:09:28.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,that we have two doorbells.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.96,0:09:30.84,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,One is for humans,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.13,0:09:32.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,and the other is for...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.05,0:09:34.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,evil spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.63,0:09:37.18,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Crap! It's because I took that talisman off!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.14,0:09:40.64,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's okay if it's for a little bit, right?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.14,0:09:44.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.18,0:09:47.65,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There's something out there!\NWhat are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.65,0:09:49.44,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll put the talisman back up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.44,0:09:51.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If it's an evil spirit,\Nit'll burn up like you did, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.77,0:09:53.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Are you going to burn me, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.53,0:09:56.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You can just get outside of our plot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.24,0:10:00.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Please wait to put up the talisman\Nuntil I step outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.83,0:10:06.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's gone. Where did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.29,0:10:08.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase! Look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.13,0:10:18.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Crap! Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.68,0:10:20.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We gotta leave the plot now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.59,0:10:21.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Go that way! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.93,0:10:23.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- Miss Ayase!\N- What!?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.06,0:10:26.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We can't get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.31,0:10:31.44,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We're trapped inside by a wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.44,0:10:33.65,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The torii gate!\NI can attach the talisman!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.65,0:10:36.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Please wait!\NYou can't put the talisman up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.11,0:10:37.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.53,0:10:39.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The torii gate is embedded into the wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.78,0:10:42.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We can't leave the plot like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.74,0:10:46.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What should we do?\NIf we don't do anything, we're seriously...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.58,0:10:50.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.30,0:10:56.13,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We're in serious trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.13,0:10:57.51,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.68,0:11:04.26,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Help... me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.26,0:11:06.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, are you okay?\NGet a grip on yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.52,0:11:08.89,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.36,0:11:18.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Black fog. So it's because of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.33,0:11:32.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Found... you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.79,0:11:41.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You are evil people.\NYou broke the promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.80,0:12:29.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Give me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.02,0:12:33.56,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,your banana organ!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.27,0:12:39.65,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Crap! What's with that evil spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.36,0:12:42.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait, you have another one down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.07,0:12:44.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.70,0:12:46.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's an alien!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.24,0:12:46.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.95,0:12:49.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There's no doubt about it! That collar!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.37,0:12:51.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's a Flatwoods Monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.75,0:12:55.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,They were first witnessed in a town\Nin America called Flatwoods.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.29,0:12:57.71,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,In Japan, they've been sighted in Yamanashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.71,0:13:00.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,They're known as aliens\Nwho are three meters tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.96,0:13:02.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Then what was that doorbell?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.80,0:13:06.18,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're saying a chime specifically for ghosts\Nreacted to an alien?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.55,0:13:12.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There are studies that say people who see\Nspiritual phenomena often see UFOs as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.23,0:13:21.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,In other words, there might be something\Nin common between ghosts and aliens!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.11,0:13:25.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Is that a buddy of the aliens\Nfrom yesterday? They're so persistent!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.49,0:13:29.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If we don't hurry up and do something\Nabout that thing, the poison fog will kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.45,0:13:33.16,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But if I'm holding Okarun's curse back,\NI can't use my psychic powers well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.16,0:13:34.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.43,0:13:50.14,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Sheesh, what a pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.77,0:13:56.89,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.35,0:13:58.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Sheesh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.08,0:14:21.13,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.13,0:14:22.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.92,0:14:25.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I will fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.67,0:14:28.38,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Please release the curse!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.51,0:14:29.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What's this so suddenly?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.09,0:14:32.14,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid of aliens!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.60,0:14:36.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Can you release just the physical curse\Nwhile keeping my head in check?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.45,0:14:53.78,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You make it sound easy, but I haven't learned\Nhow to control this power!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.78,0:14:56.75,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If all goes well, we might be able\Nto control that Granny's powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.00,0:14:59.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if I can do it right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.00,0:15:00.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Please try!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.81,0:15:17.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- Miss Ayase! Here it comes!\N- Give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.85,0:15:19.60,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Please hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.99,0:15:37.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.12,0:15:39.62,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm brimming with power!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.58,0:15:42.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But I'm totally depressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.33,0:15:44.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Whoa! Is his psyche broken?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.71,0:15:49.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,My conscious is clear, yo...\NBut I totally have the blues, yo...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.72,0:15:52.18,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What's with that manner of speech?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.18,0:15:53.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.68,0:15:55.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I am an awkward fellow after all, yo...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.64,0:15:58.64,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I told you not to say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.64,0:16:02.65,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I should just, yo...\NEradicate myself, yo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.65,0:16:05.61,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Stop talking like that! It pisses me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.07,0:16:08.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll be back in a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.90,0:16:11.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sure it won't work, yo...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.70,0:16:12.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.66,0:16:14.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Look ahead! In front of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.70,0:16:23.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,My body moved outta reflex.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.71,0:16:27.84,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So this is Turbo Granny's powers?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.00,0:16:29.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I feel so dejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.09,0:16:35.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So fast. When'd he learn to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.06,0:16:41.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This is amazing! Maybe we can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.65,0:16:51.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.53,0:16:59.62,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.25,0:17:05.96,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.96,0:17:07.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.51,0:17:13.01,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.01,0:17:14.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Miss Ayase!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.05,0:17:18.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,My body can't keep up\Nwith the power of the curse!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.10,0:17:21.60,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,My entire body feels like\Nit's going to burst into a million pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.72,0:17:24.14,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This isn't a speed that humans can move in!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.44,0:17:28.48,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But I've only damaged\Nfive fingers from that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.48,0:17:30.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,How the hell are we gonna defeat\Nsomething like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.86,0:17:33.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Like I know! Don't get pissed at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.15,0:17:36.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If we knew how to defeat it,\Nwe wouldn't be struggling!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.58,0:17:41.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.91,0:17:44.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Is it sumo wrestling?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.75,0:17:45.79,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.04,0:17:50.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If we can get its hand\Nto touch the ground, maybe we win?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.96,0:17:53.42,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase, are you a genius?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.67,0:17:54.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I knew I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.92,0:17:57.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Next time is my limit, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.64,0:18:00.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, aim for the legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.47,0:18:03.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll make the thing trip\Nwith my psychic powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.35,0:18:05.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Man, I'm so depressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.39,0:18:09.23,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We have to get a bit closer,\Nso you have to back me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.23,0:18:10.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.98,0:18:14.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Give me your banana!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:21.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I can't take it anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.78,0:18:23.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hold back the curse with my right hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.54,0:18:25.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,and I'll take on this guy with my left hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.21,0:18:27.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What a pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.08,0:18:29.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.00,0:18:30.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Sorry, Okarun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.26,0:18:37.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,All right! The hand is melting!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.63,0:18:39.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Just like how we planned!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.81,0:18:45.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.06,0:18:47.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase, run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.36,0:18:58.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.74,0:19:04.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Crap. This is bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.45,0:19:08.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.75,0:19:12.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Sheesh. You really are a nuisance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.34,0:19:16.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, sumo alien!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.42,0:19:20.18,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You put your hand on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.18,0:19:22.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's cheating, you scumbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.43,0:19:23.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.47,0:19:25.64,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Please release the curse one more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.64,0:19:28.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't care what happens to my body!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.60,0:19:31.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm gonna beat the crap outta this thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.10,0:19:32.81,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You sit and watch, Okarun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.11,0:19:36.65,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I can't let cheaters off the hook!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.86,0:19:38.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait, what are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.15,0:19:43.62,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You really pissed me off, wimpy alien.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.99,0:19:48.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.79,0:19:51.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That did nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.71,0:19:55.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Please release my curse, Miss Ayase!\NI'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.54,0:19:58.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If this keeps up, you'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.13,0:20:01.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.05,0:20:05.18,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This depth is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.26,0:20:09.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Because if I'm in this deep...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.89,0:20:13.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,it means I'm outside of the torii gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.33,0:20:35.33,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,PEACEFUL PROSPEROUS FAMILY\NWARD AGAINST EVIL AND MISFORTUNE
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.73,0:20:59.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.99,0:21:03.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We're saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.82,0:21:08.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun! We're back! See?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.24,0:21:10.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.54,0:21:15.21,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I really thought I was gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.75,0:21:18.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh! Miss Ayase, the curse!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.00,0:21:20.38,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on! Don't be a pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.38,0:21:23.09,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,At least let me indulge in the moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.09,0:21:26.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You say that, but I can't\Ndo anything about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.97,0:21:29.51,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What? You change your hairdo?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.64,0:21:31.18,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.56,0:21:36.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That kinda looks good.\NI did prefer the granny perm, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.31,0:21:38.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But you made fun of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.52,0:21:41.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? I'm kinda dizzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.23,0:21:43.65,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.65,0:21:44.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.32,0:21:45.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.32,0:21:47.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Get a hold of yourself! Miss Ayase!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.06,0:23:48.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,In 1952, several boys and soldiers, as well as\Ntheir pet dog, encountered the Flatwoods Monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.61,0:23:50.32,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The granny perm\Nwas better on you after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.15,0:23:49.61,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Back in those days, the local residents...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.61,0:23:51.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Are you listening to my story?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.11,0:23:53.62,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,EPISODE 3\NIT'S A GRANNY VS. GRANNY CLASH!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.24,0:23:53.62,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Next episode:\N"It's a Granny vs. Granny Clash!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.78,0:23:56.62,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,They're called "aliens who are\Nthree meters tall" in Japan.
